{"4098340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outpost Odyssey", "steam_appid": 4098340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon crawl and survive through randomly generated biomes with the outpost as your home base. Customize your character, find treasure &amp; loot, complete quests, and upgrade your stats &amp; abilities. Compete against other players for special rewards through online events and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress room by room, or wave by wave, enemies evolve—getting tougher and smarter, while dropping better loot. Expect to encounter mini-bosses and discover rare items that can only be found in specific locations. When you die, return to the outpost to equip new gear, upgrade stats, check quests, and prepare for another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons in each biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers three distinct modes of play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawl:</strong> See how deep into the dungeon you can venture before meeting your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Endure waves of enemies while using the environment to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Follows:</strong> Keep moving - one brush against It means instant death.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique items that effect your stats and appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training options allowing you to specialize in specific abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perk System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players through events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Progress Backup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/4d6c93f92d03e7a532750d399c45c9f6.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon crawl and survive through randomly generated biomes with the outpost as your home base. Customize your character, find treasure &amp; loot, complete quests, and upgrade your stats &amp; abilities. Compete against other players for special rewards through online events and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/728a0f57514551aad8523634420196e9.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress room by room, or wave by wave, enemies evolve—getting tougher and smarter, while dropping better loot. Expect to encounter mini-bosses and discover rare items that can only be found in specific locations. When you die, return to the outpost to equip new gear, upgrade stats, check quests, and prepare for another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.poster.avif?t=1768666715\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.webm?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098340/extras/c3007a2bade30fd78d22e81204aa799c.mp4?t=1768666715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons in each biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers three distinct modes of play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawl:</strong> See how deep into the dungeon you can venture before meeting your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Endure waves of enemies while using the environment to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Follows:</strong> Keep moving - one brush against It means instant death.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique items that effect your stats and appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training options allowing you to specialize in specific abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perk System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players through events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Progress Backup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dungeon c